<h2 id="gspb_heading-id-gsbp-2514740" class="gspb_heading gspb_heading-id-gsbp-2514740 ">Kérdése van?</h2>
<h4 id="gspb_heading-id-gsbp-d5191d9" class="gspb_heading gspb_heading-id-gsbp-d5191d9 ">Kérjen ajánlatot!</h4>
<div id="gspb_text-id-gsbp-7eeb38f" class="gspb_text gspb_text-id-gsbp-7eeb38f ">Írja meg, milyen légtechnikai feladatban segíthetünk – kollégáink rövid időn belül visszajeleznek. Telefon: +36 30 953 1703, e-mail: info@nextro.hu</div>
<div class="gspb_button_wrapper gspb_button-id-gsbp-7cf841a" id="gspb_button-id-gsbp-7cf841a"><a class="wp-block-greenshift-blocks-buttonbox gspb-buttonbox wp-element-button" href="/kapcsolat/" rel="noopener"><span class="gspb-buttonbox-textwrap"><span class="gspb-buttonbox-text"><span class="gspb-buttonbox-title">Kapcsolat</span></span><span class="gspb-buttonbox-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:5rem;height:5rem;margin:10px" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M12 1v10c0 .55-.45 1-1 1s-1-.45-1-1V3.41l-8.29 8.3c-.2.2-.45.29-.71.29s-.51-.1-.71-.29a.996.996 0 0 1 0-1.41L8.59 2H1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1s.45-1 1-1h10a1.019 1.019 0 0 1 1 1Z"></path></svg></span></span></a></div>
